Word 0..2 "if"
Whitespace 2..3 " "
LeftParen 3..4 "("
Whitespace 4..5 " "
VariableExpansion 5..10 "$flag"
Whitespace 10..11 " "
RightParen 11..12 ")"
Whitespace 12..13 " "
Word 13..17 "then"
Newline 17..18 "\n"
Whitespace 18..20 "  "
Word 20..24 "echo"
Whitespace 24..25 " "
Error 25..68 "\"still typing\n  set path = ( /bin /usr/bin\n"
errors:
UnterminatedDoubleQuote 25..68 unterminated double quote
